{"content":"<item>\r\n<title>Education &amp; Training</title>\r\n<link>https://bgorium.com/service/11-education-training.html</link>\r\n<pdalink>https://bgorium.com/service/11-education-training.html</pdalink>\r\n<guid>https://bgorium.com/service/11-education-training.html</guid>\r\n<pubDate>Tue, 18 Nov 2025 09:41:49 -0500</pubDate>\r\n<category>index</category>\r\n\n<enclosure url=\"https://bgorium.com/uploads/posts/2025-11/p-main__list-icon.png\" type=\"image/png\" />\r\n<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>BGORIUM not only develops future technologies — it also teaches them.<img src=\"https://bgorium.com/uploads/posts/2025-11/p-main__list-icon.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;\"></p>]]></content:encoded>\r\n</item><item>\r\n<title>Environmental Initiatives</title>\r\n<link>https://bgorium.com/service/10-environmental-initiatives.html</link>\r\n<pdalink>https://bgorium.com/service/10-environmental-initiatives.html</pdalink>\r\n<guid>https://bgorium.com/service/10-environmental-initiatives.html</guid>\r\n<pubDate>Tue, 18 Nov 2025 09:41:16 -0500</pubDate>\r\n<category>index</category>\r\n\n<enclosure url=\"https://bgorium.com/uploads/posts/2025-11/da22698d7ad51d10c6f98bcbcbc810e1-removebg-preview.png\" type=\"image/png\" />\r\n<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>Every BGORIUM project operates under the principle of environmental responsibility.<img src=\"https://bgorium.com/uploads/posts/2025-11/da22698d7ad51d10c6f98bcbcbc810e1-removebg-preview.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;\"></p>]]></content:encoded>\r\n</item><item>\r\n<title>Trading Platforms</title>\r\n<link>https://bgorium.com/service/9-trading-platforms.html</link>\r\n<pdalink>https://bgorium.com/service/9-trading-platforms.html</pdalink>\r\n<guid>https://bgorium.com/service/9-trading-platforms.html</guid>\r\n<pubDate>Tue, 18 Nov 2025 09:40:39 -0500</pubDate>\r\n<category>index</category>\r\n\n<enclosure url=\"https://bgorium.com/uploads/posts/2025-11/tradingplat.webp\" type=\"image/webp\" />\r\n<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>BGORIUM also builds a comprehensive digital market infrastructure.<img src=\"https://bgorium.com/uploads/posts/2025-11/tradingplat.webp\" alt=\"\" style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;\"></p>]]></content:encoded>\r\n</item><item>\r\n<title>Fintech Solutions</title>\r\n<link>https://bgorium.com/service/8-fintech-solutions.html</link>\r\n<pdalink>https://bgorium.com/service/8-fintech-solutions.html</pdalink>\r\n<guid>https://bgorium.com/service/8-fintech-solutions.html</guid>\r\n<pubDate>Tue, 18 Nov 2025 09:40:00 -0500</pubDate>\r\n<category>index</category>\r\n\n<enclosure url=\"https://bgorium.com/uploads/posts/2025-11/fintech.webp\" type=\"image/webp\" />\r\n<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p><img src=\"https://bgorium.com/uploads/posts/2025-11/fintech.webp\" alt=\"\" style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;\">BGORIUM’s fintech division merges traditional banking with digital payments and crypto-financial technologies.</p>]]></content:encoded>\r\n</item><item>\r\n<title>Blockchain Technology</title>\r\n<link>https://bgorium.com/service/7-blockchain-technology.html</link>\r\n<pdalink>https://bgorium.com/service/7-blockchain-technology.html</pdalink>\r\n<guid>https://bgorium.com/service/7-blockchain-technology.html</guid>\r\n<pubDate>Tue, 18 Nov 2025 09:39:09 -0500</pubDate>\r\n<category>index</category>\r\n\n<enclosure url=\"https://bgorium.com/uploads/posts/2025-11/blockchain.webp\" type=\"image/webp\" />\r\n<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>BGORIUM views blockchain not just as cryptocurrency, but as a foundation for trust within the modern economic system.<img src=\"https://bgorium.com/uploads/posts/2025-11/blockchain.webp\" alt=\"\" style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;\"></p>]]></content:encoded>\r\n</item>"}